{"id":"803a9dad1cd7acff","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Regular Graph","display":"df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph — ZFC Comb6 Regular Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph — ZFC Comb6 Regular Graph","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph — ZFC Comb6 Regular Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,E,d,v\\in V\">\\(W,E,d,v\\in V\\)</span> (vertex set, edge set, degree, and vertex; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> is used to avoid collision with the ambient universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\\)</span> 的有效输入满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land v\\in W\">\\(G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land v\\in W\\)</span>；仅在该域调用依赖文件给出的度数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}regular\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S(W,E,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle W,E\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(d)\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,\\langle W,E\\rangle)=d\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}regular\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S(W,E,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle W,E\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(d)\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,\\langle W,E\\rangle)=d\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This uses the simple undirected graph and cardinal-valued degree conventions of the upstream graph atom; infinite regular degrees are not excluded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,E,d,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land v\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}regular\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6RegularGraph}_S(W,E,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle W,E\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(d)\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,\\langle W,E\\rangle)=d\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1425,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1679","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph.md|58-df-zfc-comb6-regular-graph]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}